40490983,9,What type of samples were sequenced?,Plasma HIV-1 RNA,"""Sanger sequencing of plasma HIV-1 RNA was performed by the Kisumu Kenya Medical Research Institute and Nairobi National HIV Reference Laboratories.""",The paper specifies that plasma HIV-1 RNA samples were sequenced.
40490983,10,Were any sequences obtained from individuals with virological failure on a treatment regimen?,Yes,"""We conducted a retrospective cohort study of people living with HIV (PLWH) ≥ 3 years old with second-line viral failure (VF, ≥ 1000 copies/ml) at the Academic Model Providing Access to Healthcare from 2011 to 2021.""",The study focused on individuals with virological failure on second-line regimens.
40490983,11,Were the patients in the study in a clinical trial?,No,No evidence reported,The paper does not mention that the patients were part of a clinical trial.
