40763144,5,From which countries were the sequenced samples obtained?,Uganda,We conducted a retrospective cross-sectional analysis of HIVDR data in the West-Nile region of Uganda across the 161 health facilities that offer comprehensive Anti-retroviral therapy (ART) services.,"The study was conducted in Uganda, and the samples were obtained from health facilities in the West-Nile region."
40763144,6,From what years were the sequenced samples obtained?,2021-2023,"All PLHIV, regardless of age, who had been on ART for at least one year, had a non-suppressed HIV viral load (>1000 copies/ml) and underwent an HIVDR test between 1st January 2021 – 30th December 2023.",The study included samples collected between January 2021 and December 2023.
