41140464,2,Does the paper report in vitro drug susceptibility data?,"No, the paper does not report in vitro drug susceptibility data.","Using appertaining software, the sequences were analyzed for assessment of DRMs in the pol gene enzymes (PR, RT, and IN).",The paper focuses on drug resistance mutations found in the sequences and does not mention any in vitro susceptibility testing.
